// Stronger sibling of invisibility.ron, same `PassWithoutTrace`-as-Stealth
// substitution (no full render-hide primitive exists, see that file's own
// header) at a higher strength/energy for the higher circle. Sheet targets
// "a willing creature" (an ally), but `SelfBuff` always lands on the caster
// (`common/src/states/self_buff.rs`) -- same Touch-range-to-SelfOnly
// narrowing invisibility.ron/nondetection.ron/sequester.ron already
// document, kept here rather than switching to the touch-ally
// `BasicMelee`+`InGroup` pattern since Illusion's shipped concealment
// spells (invisibility, mislead) are consistently self-only in this pass.
SelfBuff(
    buildup_duration: 0.5,
    cast_duration: 0.2,
    recover_duration: 0.35,
    buffs: [
        BuffDesc(kind: PassWithoutTrace, data: BuffData(strength: 4.0, duration: Some(60.0))),
    ],
    energy_cost: 85.0,
    meta: (
        school: Some(Illusion),
        source: Some(Arcane),
        // level 4 spell -> min_level 24, the level * 6 convention.
        requirements: (min_level: Some(24)),
    ),
)
